OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a frosty start to day the
OL,6,Fday this morning will be dry with
OL,7,Fsunny intervals. Then this afternoon
OL,8,Fwill remain dry with plenty of
OL,9,Fsunshine. Cold.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FContinuing to stay dry
OL,12,Fthrough the evening, with some clear
OL,13,Fspells. Clear spells overnight will
OL,14,Flead to a cold and frosty night. Light
OL,15,Fand variable winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA dry start with sunny
OL,18,Fspells. Then clouding over during the
OL,19,Fday but remaining mostly dry. Chance
OL,20,Fof a light shower along the east coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
