OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith sunny spells on Sunday.
OL,7,FRainarriving from the west on Monday
OL,8,Fbefore it turns drier during Tuesday.
OL,9,FBreezy, particularly along coastal
OL,10,Fareas.
